{"steam_appid":3153280,"steam_name":"SAVE AMANI","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3153280/1026590131/2bdf8fe0234e5f18898bca23bf61170d74df5fc7/1790071741/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790076427","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257424644/7b0a612c87a689ae7920847d8e6558fab18667ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790076427","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/7897331496843cda0cb693414e88ac422f8fd1b9/ss_7897331496843cda0cb693414e88ac422f8fd1b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790932561","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/e43c5d2a57a4d6d06b2c49b1256a37c8f68ac428/ss_e43c5d2a57a4d6d06b2c49b1256a37c8f68ac428.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790932561","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/8ab79199f9442b26cb0e56f3c130396b3d619263/ss_8ab79199f9442b26cb0e56f3c130396b3d619263.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790932561","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/d16c7089366d539667cb9df87c30772435df6cfa/ss_d16c7089366d539667cb9df87c30772435df6cfa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790932561","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/94ad1c00b8783b68806032794bd03b466e18ab53/ss_94ad1c00b8783b68806032794bd03b466e18ab53.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790932561"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic Recreation of War Scenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city in the game has been destroyed beyond recognition by war; its former prosperity now lies in ruins. The rubble everywhere, the smoke filling the air, and the gloomy sky all convey the cruelty and ruthlessness of war, delivering an immersive experience to players.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/c0a8482fa3ad724eba311e482b8c6c0b.poster.avif?t=1790932561\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/c0a8482fa3ad724eba311e482b8c6c0b.webm?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/c0a8482fa3ad724eba311e482b8c6c0b.mp4?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Escape Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies lurk in every direction. Armed soldiers may appear at any moment, drones patrol the sky without pause, and robotic dogs patrol the necessary paths. Players must also stay alert to collapsing walls, landmines hidden in the soil, and shells that may fall from the sky. Every step is filled with uncertainty and danger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/2d0fe2773a92ff78762af846161f2a72.poster.avif?t=1790932561\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/2d0fe2773a92ff78762af846161f2a72.webm?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/2d0fe2773a92ff78762af846161f2a72.mp4?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amani can control her own small drone, which can effectively distract enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/3190a4805f93fc943729d30717937c39.poster.avif?t=1790932561\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/3190a4805f93fc943729d30717937c39.webm?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/3190a4805f93fc943729d30717937c39.mp4?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Emotionally Resonant Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through delicate plot design and touching emotional depiction, the game shows a child's pain and struggle amid war. Players are not merely completing tasks—they are experiencing a deeply emotional story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/683648915c7a2566239e12e319e555c8.poster.avif?t=1790932561\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/683648915c7a2566239e12e319e555c8.webm?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/683648915c7a2566239e12e319e555c8.mp4?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative VR Scene Recreation and Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Amani find that QR code. Players can help Amani use VR glasses to briefly escape reality and return to the warm, peaceful virtual world from before the war. Each time she puts on the VR glasses, Amani shows a long-lost smile. This sharp contrast makes people cherish peace even more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/4a4b00d87a9bc59d23ca12209c2f1ac8.poster.avif?t=1790932561\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/4a4b00d87a9bc59d23ca12209c2f1ac8.webm?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/4a4b00d87a9bc59d23ca12209c2f1ac8.mp4?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, when the glasses are taken off and reality comes into view again, Amani's heart is filled with endless sorrow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/4e1535c14458e281efd23ace91a9e05d.poster.avif?t=1790932561\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/4e1535c14458e281efd23ace91a9e05d.webm?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153280/extras/4e1535c14458e281efd23ace91a9e05d.mp4?t=1790932561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 | 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 760 or AMD R7 260x<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 需要 64 位处理器和操作系统</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 | 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770 | AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 980 or AMD R9 290X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 需要 64 位处理器和操作系统</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Racing","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["SPIRIT3D"],"publishers":["SPIRIT3D"],"release_date":"2 Oct, 2026"}